Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UndergroundParkingLotNightScene" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Limited visibility due to nighttime and parking structure lighting" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision with vehicle ahead due to reduced visibility and braking distance" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of unintended lane intrusion due to limited visibility and parking structure layout" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.55"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Limited visibility due to nighttime and parking structure lighting
Severity Score: 0.75

**Risk 2:**
Description: Potential collision with vehicle ahead due to reduced visibility and braking distance
Severity Score: 0.65

**Risk 3:**
Description: Risk of unintended lane intrusion due to limited visibility and parking structure layout
Severity Score: 0.55

---
The scene is classified as a **StateAnomaly** due to the inherent conditions of the environment (nighttime, underground parking lot) creating a state of limited visibility and potential hazards. The identified risks are primarily related to the reduced visibility and structural layout of the parking garage.